d sign of intimacy.\",\n      \"distinguishingEvidence\": \"B4 supplies conclusive visual identification, yet A5 still needs to hear the best friend's customary signal.\",\n      \"alternativeComparison\": \"Alternative b presses for emotional recognition despite convenient access; a accepts material improvement while preserving a shared act.\",\n      \"reason\": \"The original progressively removes practical reasons for the knock and thereby reveals the card's relational reason. Rereview confirms 90 and all hard gates; retain unchanged.\",\n      \"reservation\": \"A5 can sound accusatory if performed harshly; sincerity works best as a wish for familiar connection.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"exampleId\": \"S176-single-a\",\n      \"beforeHash\": \"cb35339b8ebe0351d47688d8a1607c9fba06147f63e0ce9e878d5f09d56fdb27\",\n      \"firstPass\": {\n        \"ratings\": {\n          \"cardFidelity\": {\"score\": 5, \"evidence\": \"A1 collects a shift for a late-application exception; A3 explicitly says exceptions do not expire.\"},\n          \"responseLogic\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A3 answers B2's two-year objection, but A5's 'change of pace for us both' only loosely uses B4's one phone call.\"},\n          \"relationship\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"B2 challenges elapsed time and B4 challenges proportionality, giving the presumed debt two credible objections.\"},\n          \"heightening\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A5 repeats the Saturday demand through a vague benefit rather than concretely redefining repayment.\"},\n          \"specificity\": {\"score\": 4, \"evidence\": \"A1 establishes a late application and Saturday shift, though their shared workplace connection is only implied.\"},\n          \"brevityWit\": {\"score\": 3, \"evidence\": \"A3's exception-versus-favor distinction is sharp; A5's generic 'refreshing change of pace' weakens the close.\"}\n        },\n        \"weightedTotal\": 76\n      },\n      \"beats\": [\n        {\"speaker\": \"A